<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts L&amp;G,Pru.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts L&amp;G,Pru.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it had downgraded its recommendations on British insurers Legal &amp; General Group Plc and Prudential Corp Plc to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot;.</p>
<p>Legal &amp; General shares were down 2-1/2p at 433-1/2 by 1121 GMT while Norwich Union was down 3-1/2p at 321. Prudential was up 5-1/2 at 620-1/2.</p>
<p>No further comment was available.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Marshall, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
